  "title": "Homemade Dressing",
  "description": "Hawaiian sweet bread is the base for this dressing which calls for cranberries and sunflower seeds along with the traditional chopped celery, onion and seasonings. This recipe will make enough to stuff a 12 to 15 pound turkey.",
  "authors": [
    "Diana Chastain"
